{"id": "dev000-ja", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法で「婚姻の届出の受理」を直接規定している条文はありません。\n\n関連する条文は以下の通りです：\n\n- **民法第740条**：婚姻の届出が有効であるための要件（法令違反がないこと）を定めています。\n- **民法第742条**：婚姻が無効となる場合（婚姻の届出をしない場合など）を定めています。\n- **民法第755条**：婚姻の届出前に財産契約をしない場合の法定財産制を定めています。\n- **民法第756条**：婚姻の届出までに財産契約の登記をしないと対抗できないことを定めています。\n- **民法第758条**：婚姻の届出後の財産関係の変更制限を定めています。\n\n婚姻の届出自体は戸籍法や民法の婚姻届出に関する規定（第737条など）で扱われますが、「受理」の具体的な手続きは戸籍法に規定されています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740", "742", "755", "756", "758", "737"], "invalid": ["737"], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["742", "755", "756", "758"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2128, "tokens_out": 268, "tokens": 2396, "latency_s": 16.736177597000278, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 889, "out": 54, "ms": 3679.427602999567}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1239, "out": 214, "ms": 13050.518866999482}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev000-en", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第七百四十条が「婚姻の届出の受理」を定めています。同条は、婚姻の届出が関連する法令（禁止事由や届出期間など）に違反しないことを認めた後でなければ、婚姻の届出を受理できないと定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3515, "tokens_out": 155, "tokens": 3670, "latency_s": 9.348416373000873, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 887, "out": 54, "ms": 3481.019364000531}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1237, "out": 40, "ms": 2266.8351819993404}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1391, "out": 61, "ms": 3595.8333700000367}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "740"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-ja", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責」を定めている条文は、**民法第962条**です。\n\n**内容の要約：**\n負担付遺贈の受遺者は、遺贈された財産の価額を限度としてのみ、遺言者が課した負担を履行する義務を負うとされています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["962"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["962"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 893, "tokens_out": 75, "tokens": 968, "latency_s": 4.4889494640010525, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 75, "ms": 4487.206140000126}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-en", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第千二条が「負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責」に関する規定です。\n\n同条は、負担付遺贈を受けた受遺者は、遺贈の目的物の価額を超えない限度においてのみ、負担した義務を履行する責任を負うと定めています。また、受遺者が遺贈を放棄した場合は、負担の利益を受けるべき者が自ら受遺者となることも規定しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3615, "tokens_out": 189, "tokens": 3804, "latency_s": 14.034985345000678, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 58, "ms": 4834.030952999456}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 41, "ms": 2080.5520659996546}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1453, "out": 90, "ms": 7114.718262999304}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "1002"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-ja", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告」を定めているのは、**民法第973条**です。\n\n**内容の要約：**\n遺贈を受けた者（受遺者）が、遺贈の承認または放棄をしない場合、遺言執行者や他の遺贈受遺者などが、その受遺者に対して催告を行うことができます。この催告は、受遺者が一定の期間内に意思表示をしなければならないことを通知するものです。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["973"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["973"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 895, "tokens_out": 102, "tokens": 997, "latency_s": 6.6433412639999005, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 895, "out": 102, "ms": 6641.633376000755}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-en", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**民法 第九百八十七条** (Article 987 of the Civil Code) deals with the demand for acceptance or renunciation of a legacy by a legatee.\n\nIt provides that the legatee's obligor (or other interested parties) may demand from the legatee, within a reasonable period, that they indicate whether they accept or renounce the legacy. If the legatee does not express their intention within that period, it is deemed that they have accepted the legacy.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3617, "tokens_out": 188, "tokens": 3805, "latency_s": 12.671836131001328, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 48, "ms": 4174.7154490003595}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1265, "out": 40, "ms": 2371.948384999996}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1459, "out": 100, "ms": 6118.362745999548}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "987"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-ja", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第395条が「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」を定めています。\n\n**内容要約:**\n抵当権の目的である建物を賃貸借により使用している者（抵当建物使用者）は、抵当権者がその建物の引渡しを請求した場合でも、賃貸借契約の存続期間が終了するまで、その引渡しを拒否することができます。ただし、抵当権者がその建物の使用を停止する旨の通知をした場合は、その通知を受けた日から1ヶ月以内に引渡しをしなければなりません。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2131, "tokens_out": 177, "tokens": 2308, "latency_s": 11.958745181000268, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 58, "ms": 4552.207029999408}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1238, "out": 119, "ms": 7402.704394000466}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-en", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**Article 395 of the Civil Code** deals with「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」(Deferral of delivery to a user of a mortgaged building).\n\nIt provides that a user of a mortgaged building who holds a lease that cannot be opposed to the mortgagee is not required to deliver the building to the purchaser at the auction until six months have passed from the time of the purchaser's acceptance. Exceptions apply if the user started using the building after the purchase or if the user fails to pay rent within a reasonable period after demand.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3649, "tokens_out": 217, "tokens": 3866, "latency_s": 13.857620015000066, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 58, "ms": 3245.395500000086}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1236, "out": 40, "ms": 3191.6882559999067}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1522, "out": 119, "ms": 7415.418995999062}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-ja", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法で「管理不全土地管理命令」を定めている主な条文は以下の通りです。\n\n*   **第264条の9**: 裁判所が、所有者による土地の管理が不適当で他人の権利を侵害する恐れがある場合などに、管理不全土地管理人を選任し、管理不全土地管理命令を出すことを定めています。\n*   **第264条の10**: 管理不全土地管理人が、管理不全土地管理命令の対象となる土地や動産を管理・処分する権限を有することを定めています。\n*   **第264条の11**: 管理不全土地管理人は、善良な管理者の注意をもって権限を行使しなければならないことを定めています。\n*   **第264条の12**: 管理不全土地管理人が任務に違反して損害を与えた場合など重要な事由があるときは、裁判所がその選任を解除できることを定めています。\n*   **第264条の13**: 管理不全土地管理人は、裁判所が定める額の費用の前払及び報酬を受けることができることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9", "264-10", "264-11", "264-12", "264-13"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["264-10", "264-11", "264-12", "264-13"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2140, "tokens_out": 289, "tokens": 2429, "latency_s": 18.337449058000857, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 888, "out": 53, "ms": 3396.6939420006383}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1252, "out": 236, "ms": 14936.942368000018}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-en", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article dealing with「管理不全土地管理命令」is **Article 264-9 of the Civil Code** (民法 第二百六十四条の九).\n\nIt provides that when a landowner's management of land is inappropriate and infringes or threatens to infringe upon another's rights or legally protected interests, the court may issue a management order for the land (管理不全土地管理命令) to a third party.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2136, "tokens_out": 141, "tokens": 2277, "latency_s": 9.160441297999569, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 886, "out": 53, "ms": 3647.5970589999633}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1250, "out": 88, "ms": 5509.007376000227}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
