{"id": "dev005-en", "item_id": "dev005", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["413"], "anchor": [], "answer": "受領遅滞（債権者の受領拒絶による債務不履行状態）は、民法の単一条文で定義されるものではなく、主に**第492条**（弁済提供の効果：債務者は提供時から責任を免れる）および**第493条**（債権者が受領を拒む場合の弁済提供方法）の条文を解釈して導かれる概念です。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["492", "493"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["492", "493"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 9, "tool_calls": 8, "tokens_in": 16962, "tokens_out": 450, "tokens": 17412, "latency_s": 31.78633355099919, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 885, "out": 52, "ms": 2655.7595590002165}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1251, "out": 40, "ms": 3095.085308999842}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1447, "out": 56, "ms": 3580.063548999533}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1809, "out": 40, "ms": 2066.6826399992715}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1969, "out": 54, "ms": 4501.635096999962}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2337, "out": 40, "ms": 2426.3564680004492}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2460, "out": 40, "ms": 2515.3879130011774}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2609, "out": 40, "ms": 2630.7545310010028}, {"node": "react.force", "in": 2195, "out": 88, "ms": 8302.555350001057}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "478"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 債権者", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "493"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 定義", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "492"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_artic