{"id": "dev006-ja", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "健康保険法で「子ども・子育て支援金率」を定めているのは第百六十条の二です。その直後の条文は**第百六十条の三**です。\n\n**第百六十条の三（準備金）**：保険者は、健康保険事業の費用支出に備えるため、毎事業年度末に準備金を積み立てなければならない。また、収支の見通しから事業運営に支障が生じる恐れがある場合は、厚生労働大臣に報告し、必要な措置を講じる必要がある。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5455, "tokens_out": 255, "tokens": 5710, "latency_s": 17.140563355998893, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 897, "out": 56, "ms": 4415.96005899919}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1293, "out": 44, "ms": 2454.3162469999515}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1515, "out": 44, "ms": 3949.5757659988158}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1750, "out": 111, "ms": 6315.052616000685}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev006-en", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "The article immediately after the one on「子ども・子育て支援金率」(Article 160-2) is **Article 160-3 of the Health Insurance Act**.\n\nIt provides that insurers must establish a **reserve fund** at the end of each fiscal year to prepare for expenses related to health insurance operations, following regulations set by government ordinance.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5435, "tokens_out": 220, "tokens": 5655, "latency_s": 16.50283812899943, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 892, "out": 56, "ms": 4470.29509999993}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1288, "out": 44, "ms": 3658.7291110008664}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1510, "out": 44, "ms": 3327.6097499983734}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1745, "out": 76, "ms": 5040.20202799984}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-ja", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "「法律上の減軽と刑の選択」を定めているのは刑法第69条です。この条文の直後の条文は**刑法第70条**です。\n\n**刑法第70条**の内容を要約すると、法律上の減軽事由がある場合、その減軽後の刑が、他の条文で定められている加重事由（例：再犯）に該当するときは、その加重事由を適用して刑を加重することになります。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["69", "70"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2115, "tokens_out": 153, "tokens": 2268, "latency_s": 10.088225651999892, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 897, "out": 56, "ms": 3729.0740690004895}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1218, "out": 97, "ms": 6355.882601001213}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-en", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 69 is **Article 70** of the Penal Code. It provides that when reducing a term of imprisonment or detention results in a remainder of less than one day, that remainder shall be discarded.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["69", "70"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3476, "tokens_out": 179, "tokens": 3655, "latency_s": 10.951543797998966, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 56, "ms": 3715.3634470014367}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1214, "out": 75, "ms": 4446.695792001265}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1369, "out": 48, "ms": 2784.4276079995325}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "70"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-ja", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "健康保険法で「資格の得喪の確認」を定めているのは第39条です。その直後の条文は**第40条**です。\n\n**第40条の内容要約**：\n被保険者の資格の取得又は喪失について、保険者等が確認を行う際の手続（届出、請求、職権）に関する規定を定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3746, "tokens_out": 178, "tokens": 3924, "latency_s": 12.283990695999819, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 896, "out": 55, "ms": 4462.521880001077}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1269, "out": 41, "ms": 2485.585788001117}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1581, "out": 82, "ms": 5330.987330999051}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-en", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 39 (資格の得喪の確認) in the Health Insurance Act is **Article 40 (標準報酬月額)**.\n\nArticle 40 establishes the standard remuneration monthly amount (標準報酬月額) based on the insured person's remuneration monthly amount, defining the grade classifications and corresponding amounts used for calculating insurance benefits.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6454, "tokens_out": 210, "tokens": 6664, "latency_s": 18.25952393999978, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 55, "ms": 4817.653482999958}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1264, "out": 41, "ms": 3860.725889000605}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1576, "out": 41, "ms": 3562.8896770012943}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2723, "out": 73, "ms": 6011.621287998423}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-ja", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "「譲受会社による債務の引受け」を定めているのは会社法第23条です。その直後の条文は第23条の2（id 23-2）です。\n\n**第23条の2**の内容要約：\n事業譲渡で債務を引き継がない場合、譲渡会社が債権者を害して事業を譲渡したと知っていた場合、譲受会社は承継した財産の価額を限度として債務を履行する責任を負いますが、その責任は譲渡会社の悪意を知った時から2年以内、または事業譲渡から10年以内の請求に限定されます。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23", "23-2"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 3875, "tokens_out": 279, "tokens": 4154, "latency_s": 20.98935685700053, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 1}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 898, "out": 57, "ms": 4985.0054310009}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1276, "out": 84, "ms": 4516.922253000303}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1701, "out": 138, "ms": 11480.344817000514}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-3"}, "ok": false}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-en", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "The article immediately after 第二十三条の二 (Article 23-2) on 「譲受会社による債務の引受け」 is **第二十四条 (Article 24)** of the Companies Act.\n\nIt provides that when a company transfers its business to a merchant, the transferor is deemed to be a transferor under the Commercial Code, and Articles 17 to 18-2 of the Commercial Code apply. Conversely, if a company acquires a merchant's business, the merchant is deemed the transferor, and the preceding three articles (including Article 23-2) apply.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23-2", "24", "17"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["24", "17"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5683, "tokens_out": 265, "tokens": 5948, "latency_s": 19.167520081000475, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 57, "ms": 4197.773175999828}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 42, "ms": 2761.690818000716}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1633, "out": 40, "ms": 3952.069229000699}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1886, "out": 126, "ms": 8246.848789000069}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "24"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-ja", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "民法第484条の直後の条文は**第485条**です。\n\n**第485条の内容要約**：\n弁済の費用について別段の意思表示がないときは、その費用は債務者の負担とする。ただし、債権者が住所の移転その他の行為によって弁済の費用を増加させたときは、その増加した部分については債権者の負担とする。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3573, "tokens_out": 180, "tokens": 3753, "latency_s": 12.220748936000746, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 895, "out": 54, "ms": 3224.776233000739}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1251, "out": 40, "ms": 2987.3385870014317}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1427, "out": 86, "ms": 6003.10777499908}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "弁済の場所及び時間", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "484"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-en", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 484 (弁済の場所及び時間) is **Article 485** of the Civil Code.\n\nIt provides that unless otherwise agreed, the costs of performance shall be borne by the debtor, except when the creditor has increased the costs by moving their residence or other acts.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3564, "tokens_out": 162, "tokens": 3726, "latency_s": 10.50663849600096, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 55, "ms": 4464.042353998593}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1248, "out": 41, "ms": 2324.7956480008725}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1425, "out": 66, "ms": 3712.340069001584}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "弁済の場所及び時間", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "484"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
